      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Parsons is the county seat of Tucker County and hosts historic buildings on the National Register, including the Tucker County Courthouse and Western Maryland Depot.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
